# The OpenSEO release this repo runs: one line per field, "key value...". Read only through
# scripts/openseo/lib/pin.sh, which accepts nothing but the shapes it lists.
#
# image is the multi-arch index the tag resolves to on GHCR. The sha256 line records the vendored compose.yaml, which is
# upstream's deploy/standalone/compose.yaml at commit, byte for byte. v0.1.25 is the one pin held under an exception to
# the 7-day release age gate.

